{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8c451ac3-db0e-11ef-ae7f-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8c451ab3-db0e-11ef-ade2-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":2,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"諡法：治而無眚曰平；執事有制曰平；布綱治紀曰平；又曰：惠無內德曰平。","note_content_jianti_auto":"谥法：治而无眚曰平；执事有制曰平；布纲治纪曰平；又曰：惠无内德曰平。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8c407ad1-db0e-11ef-a7a3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"衞成侯","official_note":"衞成侯是衞國的君主，屬於諸侯國的地方行政首長，在《資治通鑑》中記載其去世事件。","official_rank":"侯爵","source_snippet":"衞成侯薨","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"666e86e0-f94b-4944-ba3a-a084df3abbd0"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"平侯","official_note":"平侯是衞成侯的兒子，繼位為衞國君主，屬於諸侯國的地方行政首長，在《資治通鑑》中記載其即位事件。","official_rank":"侯爵","source_snippet":"子平侯立","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"58f9cf9a-e809-4c27-a273-443abcac6b6c"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-335,"link_td_description":"卫平侯，姬姓，子南氏，名劲，为战国诸侯国卫国君主之一。","link_td_id":"Q10001222","link_td_number_id":360342,"people_name":"平侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"平侯","people_xingming":"卫平侯","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8c407ad4-db0e-11ef-bf42-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"6衞成侯薨，子平侯立。","content_fanyi":"卫国成侯去世，他的儿子卫平侯继位。","content_jianti_auto":"6衞成侯薨，子平侯立。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":196,"number":6,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二 (周紀二) / 顯王 / 三十六年 / 第 14 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"8c407ad0-db0e-11ef-acc8-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-333},"tongjian_id":"8c407ad0-db0e-11ef-acc8-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"朱元晦","people_name_jianti_auto":"朱元晦","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"8c451ab6-db0e-11ef-af13-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"漢書音義曰：胥，相也。靡，隨也。古者相隨坐輕刑之名，謂罪不至於扑刑者，令衣褐帶索，相隨以執役。朱元晦曰：胥靡者，連鎖役作也。胥，新於翻。靡，母被翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"汉书音义曰：胥，相也。靡，随也。古者相随坐轻刑之名，谓罪不至于扑刑者，令衣褐带索，相随以执役。朱元晦曰：胥靡者，连锁役作也。胥，新于翻。靡，母被翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"8c451ab5-db0e-11ef-80c4-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c451abb-db0e-11ef-bc6b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"8c451abc-db0e-11ef-a0b9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"退齋","people_name_jianti_auto":"退斋","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"8c451abd-db0e-11ef-ac7d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：十二行本「之」下有「使人」二字；乙十一行本同；孔本同；退齋校同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：十二行本「之」下有「使人」二字；乙十一行本同；孔本同；退斋校同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c451aba-db0e-11ef-a128-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"8c451ab9-db0e-11ef-8aea-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"夫，音扶；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"夫，音扶；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":74,"tongjian_id":"8c451abe-db0e-11ef-bf0a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"申","people_name_jianti_auto":"申","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8c451ac1-db0e-11ef-a965-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"韓","people_name_jianti_auto":"韩","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8c451ac2-db0e-11ef-abfb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"此學申、韓者爲之說耳。","note_content_jianti_auto":"此学申、韩者为之说耳。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":156,"tongjian_id":"8c451ac0-db0e-11ef-86bd-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-335,"link_td_description":"卫平侯，姬姓，子南氏，名劲，为战国诸侯国卫国君主之一。","link_td_id":"Q10001222","link_td_number_id":360342,"people_name":"衞平侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"衞平侯","people_xingming":"卫平侯","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c451ac3-db0e-11ef-ae7f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"2衞平侯薨，子嗣君立。衞有胥靡亡之魏，因爲魏王之后治病。嗣君聞之，請以五十金買之。五反，魏不與，乃以左氏易之。左右諫曰：「夫以一都買一胥靡，可乎？」嗣君曰：「非子所知也！夫治無小，亂無大。法不立，誅不必，雖有十左氏，無益也。法立，誅必，失十左氏，無害也。」魏王聞之曰：「人主之欲，不聽之不祥。」因載而往，徒獻之。","content_fanyi":"卫平侯去世，他的儿子卫嗣君即位。卫国有个服劳役的囚犯逃到魏国，正为魏王的王后治病。卫嗣君听说后，派人到魏国请求用五十金把他赎回。卫国使者往返五次，魏国始终不肯交出他，卫嗣君于是要用左氏邑去交换他。身边的臣子劝谏说：“用一座都邑去买一个服劳役的囚犯，行吗？”卫嗣君说：“这不是你们能明白的！治理国家没有小事，大乱也不是一开始就起于大事。法令不确立，该惩罚的不能坚决执行，即使有十个左氏邑，也没有好处。法令确立了，该惩罚的一定执行，失去十个左氏邑，也没有害处。”魏王听到后说：“这是卫国国君的愿望，不听从恐怕会不吉利。”于是用车载着囚犯送往卫国，不要赎金，也不要左氏邑，无偿地献给卫国。","content_jianti_auto":"2衞平侯薨，子嗣君立。衞有胥靡亡之魏，因为魏王之后治病。嗣君闻之，请以五十金买之。五反，魏不与，乃以左氏易之。左右谏曰：「夫以一都买一胥靡，可乎？」嗣君曰：「非子所知也！夫治无小，乱无大。法不立，诛不必，虽有十左氏，无益也。法立，诛必，失十左氏，无害也。」魏王闻之曰：「人主之欲，不听之不祥。」因载而往，徒献之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":209,"number":2,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二 (周紀二) / 顯王 / 四十四年 / 第 2 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c451ab3-db0e-11ef-ade2-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-325},"tongjian_id":"8c451ab3-db0e-11ef-ade2-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2},{"mention_count":2,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"衞平","people_name_jianti_auto":"衞平","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a37c9115-db0e-11ef-9808-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"毛興","people_name_jianti_auto":"毛兴","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"a37c9116-db0e-11ef-9981-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"衞平，本毛興部將。","note_content_jianti_auto":"衞平，本毛兴部将。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":118,"tongjian_id":"a37c9114-db0e-11ef-9625-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"王永","people_name_jianti_auto":"王永","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"a37c9119-db0e-11ef-a718-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"丕","people_name_jianti_auto":"丕","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"a37c911a-db0e-11ef-a42a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"a37c911b-db0e-11ef-9d31-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"欲承王永檄赴秦主丕也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"欲承王永檄赴秦主丕也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":145,"tongjian_id":"a37c9118-db0e-11ef-b82c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"苻登","people_name_jianti_auto":"苻登","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a37c911d-db0e-11ef-b924-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"苻登事始此。使，疏吏翻。雍，於用翻。帥，讀曰率；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"苻登事始此。使，疏吏翻。雍，于用翻。帅，读曰率；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":247,"tongjian_id":"a37c911c-db0e-11ef-845e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"使持節","official_note":"使持節是魏晉南北朝時期授予高級官員的權力標誌，表示持有節杖代表皇帝行使權力，此處授予苻登軍事指揮權。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"推登爲使持節","start_index":174,"tongjian_id":"cff4781a-df94-44a9-8d15-248e6b29417d"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"都督隴右諸軍事","official_note":"都督隴右諸軍事是魏晉南北朝時期的軍事職務，負責隴右地區的軍事指揮，此處授予苻登統領隴右軍隊的權力。","official_rank":"高級將領","source_snippet":"都督隴右諸軍事","start_index":179,"tongjian_id":"6aef9a70-460f-439a-bcc8-aed044b86cda"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"撫軍大將軍","official_note":"撫軍大將軍是魏晉南北朝時期的將軍號，屬於高級軍事職務，此處授予苻登以增強其軍事權威。","official_rank":"高級將領","source_snippet":"撫軍大將軍","start_index":188,"tongjian_id":"dd03b7e3-84cd-4fad-a1a7-af9f85d07e62"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"雍·河二州牧","official_note":"州牧是漢代至魏晉南北朝時期的地方行政長官，負責一州或數州的軍政事務，此處授予苻登雍州和河州的統治權。","official_rank":"高級地方長官","source_snippet":"雍·河二州牧","start_index":195,"tongjian_id":"707828d2-5470-451f-a963-72cac95d01b6"},{"confidence":0.8,"official_category":"爵位","official_name":"略陽公","official_note":"略陽公是爵位名稱，表示封地在略陽地區的公爵，此處授予苻登以確立其貴族地位。","official_rank":"公爵","source_snippet":"略陽公","start_index":202,"tongjian_id":"47352e34-2be1-43b7-96f9-b2696c63fabf"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-335,"link_td_description":"卫平侯，姬姓，子南氏，名劲，为战国诸侯国卫国君主之一。","link_td_id":"Q10001222","link_td_number_id":360342,"people_name":"衞平","people_name_jianti_auto":"衞平","people_xingming":"卫平","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"a37c9120-db0e-11ef-8f46-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-335,"link_td_description":"卫平侯，姬姓，子南氏，名劲，为战国诸侯国卫国君主之一。","link_td_id":"Q10001222","link_td_number_id":360342,"people_name":"衞公","people_name_jianti_auto":"衞公","people_xingming":"卫平","start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"a37c9123-db0e-11ef-bf81-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/三、晋 十六国（卷三）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"及丕死，登称帝，都雍，与姚苌战于新平、安定、长安间。太元...","context_before":"...慕容垂，西奔晋阳称帝，既而南屯平阳，为慕容永所败，走死。","source_end_index":779,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"b45cbc26-7d88-541a-a198-e3bcf8f64306","source_start_index":730,"source_text":"其族子登，前为狄道长[狄道，见前]，枹罕诸氐共推为雍、河二州牧，帅众下陇，拔南安，丕因封为南安王。"}],"path":"历代州域形势纪要/三、晋 十六国（卷三）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"32枹罕諸氐以衞平衰老，難與成功，議廢之，而憚其宗強，累日不決。氐啖青謂諸將曰：「大事宜時定，不然，變生。諸君但請衞公爲會，觀我所爲。」會七夕大宴，青抽劍而前曰：「今天下大亂，吾曹休戚同之，非賢主不可以濟大事。衞公老，宜返初服以避賢路。狄道長苻登，雖王室疏屬，志略雄明，請共立之，以赴大駕。諸君有不同者，卽下異議。」乃奮劍攘袂，將斬異己者。衆皆從之，莫敢仰視。於是推登爲使持節、都督隴右諸軍事、撫軍大將軍、雍·河二州牧、略陽公，帥衆五萬，東下隴，攻南安，拔之，馳使請命于秦。登，秦主丕之族子也。","content_fanyi":"枹罕的氐人首领们认为卫平已经衰老，难以和他一起成就大事，便商议废黜他，但又忌惮他宗族势力强盛，连日不能决断。氐人啖青对众将说：“大事应当及时定夺，否则就会发生变故。各位只管请卫公来参加宴会，看我的行动。”适逢七夕大宴，啖青拔剑上前说道：“如今天下大乱，我们休戚与共，没有贤明的君主就不能成就大业。卫公年事已高，应当脱去官服，退位让贤。狄道县长苻登虽然是王室的远亲，但志向远大、谋略英明，请共同拥立他，去投奔秦主苻丕。诸位如有不同意的，立即提出异议。”于是挥剑捋袖，准备斩杀表示异议的人。众人都听从了他，没有人敢抬头仰视。于是推举苻登为使持节、都督陇右诸军事、抚军大将军、雍、河二州牧、略阳公，率领部众五万人东下陇山，进攻南安，攻克该城，然后派使者驰赴前秦请求指令。苻登是前秦主苻丕同族兄弟的儿子。","content_jianti_auto":"32枹罕诸氐以衞平衰老，难与成功，议废之，而惮其宗强，累日不决。氐啖青谓诸将曰：「大事宜时定，不然，变生。诸君但请衞公为会，观我所为。」会七夕大宴，青抽剑而前曰：「今天下大乱，吾曹休戚同之，非贤主不可以济大事。衞公老，宜返初服以避贤路。狄道长苻登，虽王室疏属，志略雄明，请共立之，以赴大驾。诸君有不同者，即下异议。」乃奋剑攘袂，将斩异己者。众皆从之，莫敢仰视。于是推登为使持节、都督陇右诸军事、抚军大将军、雍·河二州牧、略阳公，帅众五万，东下陇，攻南安，拔之，驰使请命于秦。登，秦主丕之族子也。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":9418,"number":32,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百六 (晉紀二十八) / 烈宗孝武皇帝中之上 / 十一年 / 第 33 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"a37c9111-db0e-11ef-817e-a0d3651f611f","year_int":386},"tongjian_id":"a37c9111-db0e-11ef-817e-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":3}],"page_size":7,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":3},"profile":{"alias_list":["衞平侯","子南劲","姬劲","子南氏","卫平侯"],"biography":"卫平侯，姬姓，子南氏，名劲，为战国诸侯国卫国君主之一。","death_year":-335,"link_td_id":"Q10001222","name":"卫平侯","number_id":360342},"relationships":[{"direction":"reverse","rank":"normal","relation_detail":"是其族人，来源文本：改立子南固的族人南劲为卫君，就是卫平侯","relation_property_display_template":"{subject}的堂表从族是{value}","relation_property_id":"P100032","relation_property_label":"堂表从族","source_person_id":"Q10010256","source_person_name":"子南固","source_person_number_id":1005785,"statement_id":"S-Q10010256-P100032-Q10001222","target_person_id":"Q10001222","target_person_name":"卫平侯","target_person_number_id":360342},{"direction":"reverse","rank":"normal","relation_detail":"继任者关系，来源文本：成侯卒後，梁文惠王改立子南勁為衞君，即衞平侯。","relation_property_id":"P100061","relation_property_label":"其他关系","source_person_id":"Q10001221","source_person_name":"卫成侯","source_person_number_id":360338,"statement_id":"S-Q10001221-P100061-Q10001222","target_person_id":"Q10001222","target_person_name":"卫平侯","target_person_number_id":360342},{"direction":"reverse","rank":"normal","relation_detail":"公子郢是卫平侯（子南劲）的祖先，来源文本：公子郢的后代以'''子南氏(子南)'''为氏，他的后代子南劲被魏惠王立为卫君，即卫平侯。","relation_property_display_template":"{subject}的孙辈及以后是{value}","relation_property_id":"P100062","relation_property_label":"孙辈及以后","source_person_id":"Q10001983","source_person_name":"公子郢","source_person_number_id":1002290,"statement_id":"S-Q10001983-P100062-Q10001222","target_person_id":"Q10001222","target_person_name":"卫平侯","target_person_number_id":360342},{"direction":"reverse","rank":"normal","relation_detail":"后代，来源文本：而彌牟另一支后代子南劲就是卫平侯。","rela